    },
    {
      "text": "Halve the tomatoes and slice up the cheese. Heat the olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Fry up the tomatoes until they start to soften.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-caprese-omelet/#wprm-recipe-58766-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/keto-caprese-omelet-step-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour the eggs on top of the tomatoes. Once the eggs start to set on the bottom, add the mozzarella cheese.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-caprese-omelet/#wprm-recipe-58766-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/keto-caprese-omelet-step-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lower the heat to medium-low and allow the omelet to fully cook through. Remove from pan and serve.",
      "group": "",
